  "pasteStaleEntryGuideTitle": "Remove the old WhisPaste entry",
  "pasteStaleEntryGuideBody": "macOS is still holding on to the Auto-Paste permission of an earlier WhisPaste version. That entry can't be switched on — it has to be removed once:\n\n1. Select “WhisPaste” in the list.\n2. Click “−” below the list.\n3. Come back to WhisPaste.\n\nAfter a restart, macOS asks you again — just allow it.",
