  "onboardingPasteSubtitleLinux": "On Linux no system dialog asks for permission. Below you can see whether you need to set up anything for it.",
  "onboardingPasteChipReady": "Auto-Paste ready",
  "onboardingPasteChipPending": "Auto-Paste access pending",
